\ story/strings.fs - the rooms' string tables (RoomXX_ObjectNames: what event commands name by
\ number - scenes, movies, room objects), the background music's tracks and the stage music's
\ files and tables. First generated by new-src's tools/roomstrings.py from the executable.
IN: story.strings
USING: room-names ;

\ ---- each room's strings (string i of the room: `room-string`) ----
$110 constant #string-rooms
create room-strings  #string-rooms cells allot  room-strings #string-rooms cells 0 fill
: strings-of ( room -- addr )  cells room-strings + ;
: room-strings! ( room -- )  latest swap strings-of ! ;   \ (the list just made: that room's)

